{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/253074-question-on-scion-trinity-cross-play-and-the-nubians","id":253074,"title":"Question on Scion-Trinity cross-play and the Nubians","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-08T23:44:48-07:00","id":253074,"title":"Question on Scion-Trinity cross-play and the Nubians","content":"Since players can do crossovers between Scion and the Trinity Trilogy, who's thinking on making a Percy Jackson meets the Justice League or Venture Bros. type of scenario?<br /> <br /> Also, historically, Ancient Egypt absorbed the Nubian tribe into their empire. Does this mean that the Nubian Pantheon will be an optional Playable Pantheon for the Egyptian camp or will it be alongside with the Orisha as a Playable Pantheon for them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T00:51:28-07:00","id":253144,"title":"","content":"Do we have confirmation that Scion-Trinity will actually be crossover compatible? I hear that they're being built on a very similar iteration of the ST system to each other, but that doesn't mean they'll truly capable of mixing.<br /> <br /> If they are (or really are close enough you can make it work)? I could see doing some interesting crossover stuff. Though I'd be more interested in something close to the Avengers where you have Aberrant style supers teaming up with/coming into conflict with explicitly divine entities.<br /> <br /> As for a Nubian Pantheon... I highly doubt the books will touch on it. There's too many real world Pantheons throughout history to cover them all. If they're in the book, it makes more sense for them to be absorbed than somehow allied with the Orisha.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T02:57:10-07:00","id":253178,"title":"","content":"My greatest hope for Scion 2 is that they change the way that legend works so that gods have several ranges of power. Think the DnD equvivalent: Demi-god, lesser god, intermediate deity, greater deity.<br /> <br /> That could potentially lead to divine feudalism. Absorbed pantheon agreeing to serve a more powerful pantheon in exchange for protection. It would open up so -many- exciting political storylines for Scion. We've halfly done this in my games with the mongolian pantheon who officially has been absorbed into the Celestial Beuocracy, although are fighting violently to free themselves.<br /> <br /> I can easily see the Nubian pantheon as giving some of their power to the Egyptian pantheon for an alliance that protects them both <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/593-gemstone","name":"Gemstone","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T10:36:21-07:00","id":253454,"title":"","content":"BOth are using the same core system, but that doesn't necessarily mean the two will be cross-compatible. You could almost certainly do it with a bit of work, but it won't be as simple as dropping a Scion character into a Trinity game or vice versa.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T16:14:25-07:00","id":253655,"title":"","content":"Well, <i>I'm</i> going to do the hacking so that I can have novas and scions cross over. Not sure how easy it'll be, but I know already that I want to run that game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T17:40:43-07:00","id":253693,"title":"","content":"Oh, for sure. During one of the development meetings when I realized that you could theoretically play the Avengers with Thor as <i>literally Thor</i>, I was positively giddy. It's a great idea. I just don't think the directions we're going in with the books will make it seamless out of the box.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T17:52:07-07:00","id":253696,"title":"","content":"Yeah, agreed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T23:43:22-07:00","id":253867,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gemstone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/253074-question-on-scion-trinity-cross-play-and-the-nubians?p=253178#post253178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My greatest hope for Scion 2 is that they change the way that legend works so that gods have several ranges of power. Think the DnD equvivalent: Demi-god, lesser god, intermediate deity, greater deity.<br /> <br /> That could potentially lead to divine feudalism. Absorbed pantheon agreeing to serve a more powerful pantheon in exchange for protection. It would open up so -many- exciting political storylines for Scion. We've halfly done this in my games with the mongolian pantheon who officially has been absorbed into the Celestial Beuocracy, although are fighting violently to free themselves.<br /> <br /> I can easily see the Nubian pantheon as giving some of their power to the Egyptian pantheon for an alliance that protects them both <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>One thing we know is that pantheons can be formed at Demigod level, so you might have a Demigod-level pantheon that allies with/is absorbed by a God-level pantheon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-10T04:37:45-07:00","id":253992,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gemstone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/253074-question-on-scion-trinity-cross-play-and-the-nubians?p=253178#post253178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We've halfly done this in my games with the mongolian pantheon who officially has been absorbed into the Celestial Beuocracy, although are fighting violently to free themselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>OMG I love this idea so very much. May I borrow it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2608-squee","name":"Squee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2608_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T11:09:29-07:00","id":254430,"title":"","content":"This is why I love the Scion forum so much: all the myriad ideas.<br /> I am with Rose. I will be doing the hacking to make this happen. I have had a little bit of a weird cross over headcanon going that incorporates the cWoD and Scion and Aeoniverse and Exalted. In it, you have a nova who has Universe Creation. The nova is insane and so he makes the Wyld. His friends jump through there and use various powers to make Creation. They are the Primordial. More novas see it and decide they can do better and create the cWoD.<br /> We have another group who manage to get the same nova to create the world of Scion and these powerful novas end up morphing into being Titans. Yes, this can be also tied into nWoD if you have a member of the Gentry be a True Fae.<br /> Yes, this shows that I love to have crossovers. Yes, I will be crossing Aeoniverse and Scion as soon as the books show up. If nothing else, I can come up with a new version of my headcanon that ties all White Wolf games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-12T03:34:34-07:00","id":255181,"title":"","content":"I totally like hearing they'll be at least somewhat cross over compatible. Because nothing says Post-Modern Superheroes like having them beat the crap out of a bunch of Gods. Like Jeff Smax knocking Thor out in &quot;Top 10&quot;, Superman beating the crap out of Apollo in a recent issue of Superman &amp; Wonderwoman.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3769-orphan81","name":"Orphan81","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3769_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}